  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Logic : (1st number × 2nd number) = 3rd number - (1st number ÷ 2nd number)\n\nGiven :\n\n__\n \n• (10, 5, 52)\n\n**10 × 5**__ = 52 - __**(10 ÷ 5)**__\n\n50 = __**52 - 2**__\n\n50 = 50 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd, \n\n__\n \n• (35, 7, 250)\n\n35 × 7__ = 250 - __(35 ÷ 7)__\n\n245 = __**250** - 5__\n\n245 = 245 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : (8, 4, 34)\n\n8 × 4__ = 34 - __(8 ÷ 4)__\n\n32 = __**34** - 2__\n\n**32 = 32 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : (14, 8, 90)\n\n14 × 8__ = 90 - __(14 ÷ 8)__\n\n112 = __90 - 1.75__\n\n112 ≠ 88.25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : (8, 9, 10)\n\n8 × 5__ = 10 - __(8 ÷ 9)__\n\n40 = __10 - 0.88__\n\n40 ≠ 9.12 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : (20, 5, 300)\n\n20 × 5__ = 300 - __(20 ÷ 5)__\n\n100 = __300 - 4__\n\n100 ≠ 75 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****(8, 4, 34)\"**.",
